CORE
pure_calls.c
--evaluation-order-check
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^\[main\.evaluation-order\.1\] line 12 value of a is independent of evaluation order: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.evaluation-order\.2\] line 12 value of b is independent of evaluation order: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Calls without conflicting side effects are evaluation-order independent:
the check explores both orders of the calls and finds that the arguments read
the same values in either order.
